command-description-codes-addproto = Adds a code from a SamuraiCode prototype.
command-description-codes-adddataset = Adds a code picked from a Dataset of SamuraiCode prototypes.
command-description-codes-addraw = Adds a code that was manually typed.
command-description-codes-ensure = Ensures the input entity has the SamuraiCodesComponent. and informs them of such.
command-description-codes-rm = Removes a code specified by the index of said code.

cmd-samuraishared-desc = Prints the shared samurai code(s) to the console.
cmd-samurairerollshared-desc = Rerolls the shared code(s) between all samurai and tells them their codes have changes.
